OL,3,AMauritius reels from worst riots in
OL,4,Adecades after woman shot by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in Mauritius imposed an
OL,7,Fovernight curfew overnight to quell the
OL,8,Fworst riots to break out on the Indian
OL,9,FOcean island in decades.
OL,11,FPeaceful protests over water shortages
OL,12,Fand the high cost of living that
OL,13,Fstarted a week ago erupted into
OL,14,Fviolence on Friday when a woman was
OL,15,Fshot and wounded by police at a
OL,16,Froadblock.
OL,18,FThe circumstances of the shooting are
OL,19,Fnot clear, but the officer has since
OL,20,Fbeen arrested and remanded in custody.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
