OL,3,AMauritius reels from worst riots in
OL,4,Adecades after woman shot by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Navin Ramgoolam ordered
OL,7,Fthe curfew on Tuesday, warning against
OL,8,Fthose "acting against the interests of
OL,9,Fthe country", which is a tourism and
OL,10,Ffinancial services hub.
